WEBVTT

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:26.970
Seeking out a single ray of light,
hito-suji no hikari wo motome

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:34.210
All I can do is wander on, no matter how far.
hitasura doko made mo tada samayou

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:42.950
As I breathe a sigh not unlike surrender,
akirame ni nita tameiki wo tsuki-nagara

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:52.270
I don't want to fear how I've been hurt, all the time.
kizutsuku koto wo osoretaku nai yo itsu mo

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:54.650
Set me free now!

00:00:54.670 --> 00:01:01.060
Come on, let it all go, to the far reaches of time,
saa tokihanate subete toki no kanata ni

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:01.080
From that which binds the soul!
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo
Come on, let it all go, to the far reaches of time,
saa tokihanate subete toki no kanata ni

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:06.910
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo
From that which binds the soul!

00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:09.200
For my heartbeat!

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:11.690
Make freedom your weapon,
jiyuu wo buki ni

00:01:11.690 --> 00:01:11.760
And you are sure to attain it!
kitto te ni ireru no yo
Make freedom your weapon,
jiyuu wo buki ni

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:15.470
kitto te ni ireru no yo
And you are sure to attain it!

00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:15.510
The power to believe and dream is there
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo
kitto te ni ireru no yo
And you are sure to attain it!

00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:21.590
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo
The power to believe and dream is there

00:01:21.590 --> 00:01:21.630
for you to go on living.
ikite yuku tame ni
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo
The power to believe and dream is there

00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:25.960
ikite yuku tame ni
for you to go on living.

00:02:06.710 --> 00:02:10.720
Program to cut free Block 808 complete!

00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:14.050
Commencing separation of Block 808.

00:02:14.050 --> 00:02:16.820
Once the operation completes, take shelter right away!

00:02:23.730 --> 00:02:25.400
Please...

00:02:25.400 --> 00:02:27.230
...work!

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:56.800
Work to cut loose the medical station's residential section Block 808 is complete!

00:02:56.800 --> 00:03:00.370
The infiltrated soldiers are continuing on, headed for Block 810!

00:03:00.370 --> 00:03:03.600
Change all the shuttle buses over for towing use!

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:05.370
Hurry and launch them!

00:03:17.050 --> 00:03:18.720
It's all right.

00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:23.390
It's not shallow, but it isn't life-threatening either.

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:26.390
Of course it isn't. I'll be damned...

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:29.400
...if I'm going to check out in a place like this!

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:30.990
Alicia...

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:42.340
Sounds like he's coming along successfully. We have to hurry too!

00:03:42.340 --> 00:03:48.350
Don't force yourself. You'd better escape with Su and the others.

00:03:48.350 --> 00:03:50.020
But...

00:03:50.020 --> 00:03:52.350
Having someone injured along will just slow us down.

00:03:52.350 --> 00:03:54.510
H- hey, now!

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:06.700
Get Alicia some help, Rick. I want the two of you to get out first.

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:13.370
Please! As for Tony, Marlene and I will manage something.

00:04:13.370 --> 00:04:17.380
Sheesh, what choice do I have? But, hey...

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:20.370
Don't you let Marlene get hurt!

00:05:38.320 --> 00:05:39.990
That's it!

00:05:39.990 --> 00:05:42.330
The Main Computer is just over there!

00:05:42.330 --> 00:05:44.090
That's where Tony is...!

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:54.010
Marlene, are you hurt?

00:05:54.010 --> 00:05:55.870
No. Here they come!

00:06:02.010 --> 00:06:04.310
You guys are in my way!

00:06:20.700 --> 00:06:22.690
There's no stopping them, This way!

00:06:27.370 --> 00:06:28.710
Marlene!

00:06:28.710 --> 00:06:31.640
Are you okay, Marlene!?

00:06:31.640 --> 00:06:33.650
More or less...

00:06:33.650 --> 00:06:37.650
We may be trapped here, but this way is a dead end too.

00:06:37.650 --> 00:06:39.410
What should we do!?

00:06:47.660 --> 00:06:51.330
Yuji, the control panel!

00:06:51.330 --> 00:06:53.670
This is the generator room!

00:06:53.670 --> 00:06:59.000
If we shut this system down, we should be able to put a stop to the Automatons' power supply!

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:01.340
I think it will work against Tony as well!

00:07:01.340 --> 00:07:06.110
But, if we do that, what happens to the mission Su and the others are doing?

00:07:06.110 --> 00:07:09.340
If power to the whole station drops...

00:07:17.020 --> 00:07:23.030
Each Block in the station is provided with its own auxiliary power.

00:07:23.030 --> 00:07:24.860
Don't worry.

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:14.010
That's all of them.

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:16.350
All right, let's hurry!

00:08:16.350 --> 00:08:20.280
Dammit, is our side completely out of luck here?

00:08:22.690 --> 00:08:25.360
That's more like it!

00:08:25.360 --> 00:08:28.030
System restored. Now operating normally.

00:08:28.030 --> 00:08:31.060
We don't know when this is going to stop, either.

00:08:31.060 --> 00:08:32.970
I think we've just about reached our limit.

00:08:32.970 --> 00:08:36.590
I know. Begin evacuating all personnel!

00:08:42.980 --> 00:08:44.980
What do we do here?

00:08:44.980 --> 00:08:50.650
If Tony is in control of the system, all we can do is force our way through.

00:08:50.650 --> 00:08:56.920
However, there's just no imagining what steps he'll take against those who oppose him.

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:12.000
Tony! It's me! Kaido Yuji!

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:14.100
I'm coming in there now!

00:09:34.960 --> 00:09:37.960
How good of you to come, Kaido Yuji.

00:09:37.960 --> 00:09:41.630
I wouldn't have thought that you would be the one to stand in my way.

00:09:41.630 --> 00:09:43.300
Tony!

00:09:43.300 --> 00:09:44.290
However...

00:09:56.310 --> 00:10:00.980
...at this level, you will serve to buy no time whatsoever!

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:24.440
Tony...

00:10:28.350 --> 00:10:30.620
You shouldn't be surprised.

00:10:30.620 --> 00:10:36.620
With this thing activating my B cells for me, it's just right for helping me achieve my purpose.

00:10:36.620 --> 00:10:38.420
Your purpose?

00:10:44.630 --> 00:10:46.630
Is this...

00:10:46.630 --> 00:10:48.300
Is this your purpose!?

00:10:48.300 --> 00:10:51.340
What the hell will come of you doing something like this!?

00:10:51.340 --> 00:10:53.970
Are you saying that doing this is the reason we were awakened!?

00:10:53.970 --> 00:10:55.960
Eh, Tony!?

00:10:58.310 --> 00:11:01.280
Why did you have to drag Alicia into this!?

00:11:01.280 --> 00:11:06.110
Is there some reason why you had to make that girl help you do all this!?

00:11:08.320 --> 00:11:11.990
Everything was determined by the grand will.

00:11:11.990 --> 00:11:13.730
No matter how you may struggle,

00:11:13.730 --> 00:11:19.660
we still have the same cells as the Blue nestled within our bodies.

00:11:19.660 --> 00:11:23.900
However, we are human.

00:11:23.900 --> 00:11:28.670
As humans, we therefore perceive the truth of the grand will, and as humans,

00:11:28.670 --> 00:11:32.680
we therefore are capable under our own will of being the ones who put it into practice.

00:11:32.680 --> 00:11:35.280
Are you saying you wanted this for yourself!?

00:11:35.280 --> 00:11:39.350
For people to kill other people!?

00:11:39.350 --> 00:11:43.360
That's the reason you've done this?

00:11:43.360 --> 00:11:47.030
Why!?

00:11:47.030 --> 00:11:48.690
Answer me, Tony!

00:11:48.690 --> 00:11:52.700
Yuji, anything you say to him now is...

00:11:52.700 --> 00:11:54.370
Tony!!

00:11:54.370 --> 00:11:56.570
Don't you understand yet?

00:11:56.570 --> 00:12:00.370
Why the Blue suddenly swept over the Earth's surface?

00:12:00.370 --> 00:12:06.040
Why those of us, who have the same B cells, awoke during this era?

00:12:07.380 --> 00:12:12.050
Yes, this was no simple coincidence.

00:12:12.050 --> 00:12:14.050
The B cells were born,

00:12:14.050 --> 00:12:17.720
unmistakably, of the same Earth that we lived upon!

00:12:17.720 --> 00:12:19.720
Wha...!

00:12:19.720 --> 00:12:21.390
They were what!?

00:12:21.390 --> 00:12:24.230
The Earth knew, all right.

00:12:24.230 --> 00:12:29.400
In time, mankind would give birth to the Blue by their own hand!

00:12:29.400 --> 00:12:33.870
We would awake, and making a sacrifice of our ugly egos,

00:12:33.870 --> 00:12:39.040
our power would be stimulated to the point of no return!

00:12:45.680 --> 00:12:46.980
That's a lie...!

00:12:54.360 --> 00:12:57.430
Everything was plotted out.

00:12:57.430 --> 00:13:01.700
This is no more than one process of purification that the life that is the Earth...

00:13:01.700 --> 00:13:06.100
...began many years ago in order to stamp out mankind,

00:13:06.100 --> 00:13:08.710
as they continued to increase without thought.

00:13:08.710 --> 00:13:11.710
That's a lie!!

00:13:11.710 --> 00:13:15.050
In which case, I shall follow the judgment of the Earth.

00:13:15.050 --> 00:13:18.380
No, by putting into practice the grand will...

00:13:18.380 --> 00:13:20.780
I will become this world's messiah!

00:13:27.060 --> 00:13:31.400
Be gone!! Everyone and everything!!

00:13:31.400 --> 00:13:32.330
Yuji!

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:34.130
Stop this, Tony!!

00:13:48.350 --> 00:13:52.340
The medical station is... Holy shit! All units, evasive!

00:13:58.020 --> 00:14:00.360
The station has started to move!

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:04.030
Let's hurry to the dock!

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:05.360
Lu, quickly!

00:14:05.360 --> 00:14:08.890
I know! Don't rush me!

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:11.730
Okay, let's g...

00:14:59.680 --> 00:15:03.690
Stop this! Stop this already, Tony!

00:15:03.690 --> 00:15:08.160
Do you see? As it happens, to the grand will,

00:15:08.160 --> 00:15:12.030
it was humans themselves that were nothing more than ugly insects.

00:15:12.030 --> 00:15:13.770
Very soon now...

00:15:13.770 --> 00:15:19.370
Very soon now, that planet will be born again into the original, beautiful Earth...

00:15:19.370 --> 00:15:23.710
Stop this station now!

00:15:23.710 --> 00:15:27.050
Or else... I'll...

00:15:27.050 --> 00:15:28.710
I'll...

00:15:28.710 --> 00:15:32.050
"Or I will shoot you," eh?

00:15:37.990 --> 00:15:39.050
Yuji!!

00:15:54.340 --> 00:15:57.680
Dammit, Tony...!

00:15:57.680 --> 00:16:01.810
What foolishness. As long as there are humans in this world,

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:05.350
new Blue will eternally continue being born.

00:16:05.350 --> 00:16:08.920
To this... hell, for which no one knows when it will stop,

00:16:08.920 --> 00:16:14.690
even though I am ready to bring it all to an end...

00:16:14.690 --> 00:16:19.630
What a pity. I thought you and I would understand each other!!

00:16:39.320 --> 00:16:44.080
A- Alicia... Alicia...

00:17:30.700 --> 00:17:31.730
Yuji!

00:17:36.980 --> 00:17:37.840
Marlene!!

00:17:43.980 --> 00:17:46.650
Why?

00:17:46.650 --> 00:17:49.990
Why were we awakened into an age where we knew no one?

00:17:49.990 --> 00:17:54.020
Why were we suddenly thrust into the middle of a hellish fight?

00:17:57.330 --> 00:18:00.770
What attachment do I have to this world!?

00:18:00.770 --> 00:18:06.000
Those rotten humans can all just die!

00:18:06.000 --> 00:18:11.340
I... We are alive now!

00:18:11.340 --> 00:18:16.970
Does anyone have the right to deprive those who wish to go on living of their lives!?

00:18:19.680 --> 00:18:23.690
Yu... ji...

00:18:23.690 --> 00:18:25.920
You miserable worm!!

00:18:28.360 --> 00:18:29.350
Tony!!

00:18:50.980 --> 00:18:55.320
Range to medical station, 3500. It will soon reach the danger area!

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:58.990
Launch preparations for the blasting shuttles are complete.

00:18:58.990 --> 00:19:02.330
Is this the last one? Lu!

00:19:02.330 --> 00:19:05.630
I'm closing the hatch! All personnel take your seats!!

00:19:05.630 --> 00:19:07.330
Secure your seatbelts!

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:12.100
Wait for us! Su! Lu! Can you hear me? This is Kaido Yuji!

00:19:12.100 --> 00:19:15.010
Marlene is with me! We've defeated Tony!

00:19:15.010 --> 00:19:17.340
We're heading for the dock now!

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:22.340
- Yuji!! Wait before launching the blasting shuttles!
- Please wait just a bit longer! You're right before our eyes!

00:19:31.620 --> 00:19:33.590
You think I'll let that happen...?

00:19:33.590 --> 00:19:37.630
I am the messiah...

00:19:37.630 --> 00:19:47.970
My will is the Earth's will... I won't let any of you go back ali...

00:19:47.970 --> 00:19:51.640
That's enough, Tony.

00:19:51.640 --> 00:19:53.310
Alicia...

00:19:53.310 --> 00:19:57.880
We... just woke up a little early.

00:19:57.880 --> 00:20:01.820
This must still just be... the middle of a bad dream...

00:20:01.820 --> 00:20:09.990
So, let's go back to sleep again... I'll sleep next to you...

00:20:09.990 --> 00:20:15.000
Alicia!? Stop!! What are you thinking!?

00:20:15.000 --> 00:20:19.340
Together with me, we're going to carry out the Earth's will...

00:20:19.340 --> 00:20:24.000
- Good night, Tony...
- What's wrong with you, Alicia!? Stop! Let me go!

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:40.280
Rick!? Alicia!?

00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:58.310
Farewell, Yuji...

00:20:58.310 --> 00:21:00.680
You live on...

00:21:30.300 --> 00:21:39.790
Although the days when we smiled again and again
hohoemi kasaneta hibi ga

00:21:41.150 --> 00:21:45.920
Have passed away into dreams,
maboroshi ni natte mo

00:21:48.130 --> 00:21:55.070
I will surely not lose my way.
watashi wa kitto mayowanai

00:21:55.190 --> 00:22:01.240
To go on to the future,
mirai ni yuku tame ni

00:22:01.390 --> 00:22:07.660
To become an adult,
otona ni naru tame ni

00:22:08.020 --> 00:22:14.850
I again recall now the memories
mogaite kita omoide wo kokoro de

00:22:15.040 --> 00:22:20.010
twisting in my heart.
ima wa kurikaesu

00:22:20.110 --> 00:22:26.070
I'm living in one time,
hitotsu no toki wo iki

00:22:26.370 --> 00:22:32.350
While choosing two dreams,
futatsu no yume erabi

00:22:32.960 --> 00:22:39.830
And love taught me what it means...
soshite ai ga oshiete kureta yo ne

00:22:40.010 --> 00:22:46.690
to cherish someone.
hito wo omou imi

00:22:50.590 --> 00:22:53.930
<i>What is the meaning of all of</i> <i>the fighting that I've done?</i>

00:22:53.930 --> 00:22:58.360
<i>So many friends have died,</i> <i>and only I have survived.</i>

00:22:58.360 --> 00:23:01.930
<i>In the end, I was</i> <i>unable to save anyone.</i>

00:23:01.930 --> 00:23:08.270
<i>To what end did I wake up? To</i> <i>what end did Tony and Alicia die?</i>

00:23:08.270 --> 00:23:10.640
<i>At this rate, it will never end!</i>

00:23:10.640 --> 00:23:13.510
<i>I... I am staying</i> <i>together with Marlene!</i>
